  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: bbec7a84e96ca95458eba143068d1dd0, type: 3}
  title: Keijiro MidiJack
  sections:
  - heading: Deprecated
    text: MidiJack is deprecated though is still offered here for legacy support.
      Minis is the new recommended add-on for live MIDI input.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Installation
    text: Once this add-on has been imported from the Timeflow Samples in the Package
      Manager, no other installtion is required.
    linkText: Keijiro MidiJack on GitHub
    url: https://github.com/keijiro/MidiJack
  - heading: Remove Older Versions
    text: If you imported MidiJack seperately in your project, please remove it and
      use the one included, otherwise compile errors will occur due to assembly definition
      referenced by Timeflow.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Remove MIDIJACK Symbol
    text: If you previously added MIDIJACK to the Scripting Define Symbols in Player
      Settings, you may now remove it since this is automatically handled by the
      assembly definitions included in the Timeflow package.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Midi Receiver
    text: 'MidiJack is only required if you wish to use the MidiReceiver behavior
      in Timeflow to handle live input from a MIDI device. Otherwise, without MidiJack
      or any further modification you may use MIDI files using the MidiFile component
      included. '
    linkText: MIDI Documentation
    url: https://axongenesis.gitbook.io/timeflow/reference/behaviors/midi
